      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44699/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together sugar, cocoa, cornstarch, and salt in a saucepan. Place over medium heat, and stir in milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j0r3v79qReMMRZWWQI-Vra2e9AU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/44699-chocolate-cornstarch-pudding-mfs-step-3-BP-2545-4x3-491c9a7843a84689b2dea90ab57c2114.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44699/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil, and cook, stirring constantly, until the mixture thickens enough to coat the back of a metal spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2bSR8btnsxZFlxDPv3xKY4njJAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/44699-chocolate-cornstarch-pudding-mfs-step-4-BP-2565-4x3-0c76a37a5c1d4418a349c39597e4b0ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/44699/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat, and stir in butter and vanilla.",
